From 32134f680b4f399c1de09734357943fdd222fd6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Madhavan <arun_madhavan@comcast.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Feb 2026 11:05:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] RDKEVL-7397: Add support for checking EGL surfaceless and
 pbuff caps dynamically in rdk starboard

Throw early error on eglInitialize failure

Reduce the CPU utilization of cobalt on surfaceless platforms

Add proper documentation for the surfaceless platform support wrapper

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: fix copilot review

Reason For Change: Fix EGL pbuffer/surfaceless detection and stubs:
make capability probing thread-safe, detect pbuffer support via
config enumeration, return unique fake pbuffers, and log config
filtering only once to avoid false negatives, races, and log spam.

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: Harden fake pbuffer detection by adding a magic tag to each pool slot, preventing rare false positives from the pointer-range check.

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: address review comment - Harden EGL wrapper: fix fake pbuffer races, extension matching, and attrib parsing

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: Prevent premature EGL capability caching and harden fake pbuffer surface validation

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: Remove unused headers, use meaningful function name

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: Replace tautological kMagic size static_assert with type-trait type check

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: rename to 'emulated' for surfaceless wrappers

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: Harden emulated pbuffer EGL wrappers and attrib_list parsing

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: add rate-limited warning when the pool reaches critical levels

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: Fix EGL emulated pbuffer safety

Reason for Change: Add retryable capability detection, early chooseConfig init, and in-use validation

RDKEVL-7403, RDKEAPPRT-504: fix the alignment issues
